  "prefLabel": "Plc 610.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 610.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to implement RSA 314-A:2, IV relative to the microblading of eyebrows.\n\n(b) This part shall apply to any individual who is not a licensed body art tattoo practitioner who wishes to engage in microblading.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 600) #13337, eff 1-27-22; ss by #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36 (formerly Plc 605.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc600.html"
}
